# Golden-day fixtures hold licensed vendor (Sharadar) data — NEVER commit (repo is PUBLIC).
# The harness rebuilds them from the PIT store; their content_hash + metadata is committed in
# data/fixtures/locks/ for replay/reproducibility. Tests skip if the local fixture is absent.
data/fixtures/recorded/
data/fixtures/golden/

# Agent-output memos quote licensed figures — never commit (WP3 CP1b guard, item 8b). BACKSTOP to the
# primary structural defense core/agent_output.safe_agent_output_dir: even a stray writer at repo root
# (the Path("")-is-truthy near-miss) is ignored. Agent memos live in the gitignored var/cp1_memos/.
/*BULL-0*.json
var/cp1_memos/

# Secrets (NEVER commit)
secrets/
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json

# Vendor API keys in files (env vars only)
.env
.env.*.local
